# Coding agent for omp, forge, and codecompanion. Clients use the alias, so a
# quant swap needs no client change. A base swap can: check `ollama show` for
# capabilities clients rely on (tools, thinking), then `omp models refresh`.
# Base chosen by agent-bench: ornith-q4 13/24 vs laguna-q4 12/24, ~25% faster,
# half the tool errors (matrix7, 2026-11-07).
FROM hf.co/ornith-ai/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B-GGUF:Q4_K_M
# Clients sized to this: omp discovers it as contextWindow; forge max_tokens +
# compact.token_threshold must stay below it.
PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
# Ornith's recommended sampling, as benched.
PARAMETER temperature 0.6
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
